  "title": "PointLight",
  "description": "A world-space point light. Plain mutable data - no scene node, no transform, no parenting. Move one by assigning x/y (or through setPosition) and the change takes effect on the next LightingSystem.commit. A light contributes to shading only while it is registered with a LightingSystem.",
